    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>This is a 2D-style role-playing game featuring real-time combat.</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fiery Tale</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To free humanity from oppression and enslavement, raise your battle sword and shatter the arrogance of the gods! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your people by your side, lift the banner high and carve a path toward humanity\u2019s future, no matter the hardships and pain along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/91d97cefa37ab8036094e607e061b8aa.poster.avif?t=1747039489\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/91d97cefa37ab8036094e607e061b8aa.webm?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/91d97cefa37ab8036094e607e061b8aa.mp4?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Battle Against All Odds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last hope of humanity, will you stand in battle against overwhelming odds and slay countless invading foes? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sword in your hand represents the hope of humanity's progress, and every spell you cast paves the way for a brighter future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/6575dfc8b6c8ce3cb534f3a61512e016.poster.avif?t=1747039489\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/6575dfc8b6c8ce3cb534f3a61512e016.webm?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/6575dfc8b6c8ce3cb534f3a61512e016.mp4?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge powerful enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the foes, there are not only ordinary adversaries but also formidable ones. Be cautious of their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/e15efce83f827c237d6aed753305ad94.poster.avif?t=1747039489\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/e15efce83f827c237d6aed753305ad94.webm?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/e15efce83f827c237d6aed753305ad94.mp4?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Emperor of the World. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you start as a youth emerging from a humble village, but as the story unfolds, you will become humanity's leader, then sovereign. You will lead your people to sweep across the continent, becoming this world's one true emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>This is a 2D-style role-playing game featuring real-time combat.</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fiery Tale</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To free humanity from oppression and enslavement, raise your battle sword and shatter the arrogance of the gods! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your people by your side, lift the banner high and carve a path toward humanity\u2019s future, no matter the hardships and pain along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/91d97cefa37ab8036094e607e061b8aa.poster.avif?t=1747039489\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/91d97cefa37ab8036094e607e061b8aa.webm?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/91d97cefa37ab8036094e607e061b8aa.mp4?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Battle Against All Odds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last hope of humanity, will you stand in battle against overwhelming odds and slay countless invading foes? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sword in your hand represents the hope of humanity's progress, and every spell you cast paves the way for a brighter future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/6575dfc8b6c8ce3cb534f3a61512e016.poster.avif?t=1747039489\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/6575dfc8b6c8ce3cb534f3a61512e016.webm?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/6575dfc8b6c8ce3cb534f3a61512e016.mp4?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge powerful enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the foes, there are not only ordinary adversaries but also formidable ones. Be cautious of their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/e15efce83f827c237d6aed753305ad94.poster.avif?t=1747039489\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/e15efce83f827c237d6aed753305ad94.webm?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239080/extras/e15efce83f827c237d6aed753305ad94.mp4?t=1747039489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Emperor of the World. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you start as a youth emerging from a humble village, but as the story unfolds, you will become humanity's leader, then sovereign. You will lead your people to sweep across the continent, becoming this world's one true emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
